  "body": "This PR simplifies and corrects the architecture for lazy loading as per the design in [this document](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1EQ-6wyXj7z0urPvIKRzNgKN0YkPHxg9-NI5b6H6X1nE/edit).\n\nSummary:\n - Removes the _ready to be lazy loaded_ flag, in favor of the _lazy load resumption steps_\n - Clears and invokes the _lazy load resumption steps_ from the lazy load IntersectionObserver callback\n - Clears and invokes the _lazy load resumption steps_ when the img's lazy load attribute is set to the Eager state\n - Removes the unnecessary in-parallel and task-posting machinery from _updating the image data_, in favor of setting the _lazy load resumption steps_ and early-returning\n\nThis fixes a bug in the spec where it was impossible to lazy load an image more than once, which we have a test for.\n\nAs mentioned, this removes the unnecessary in-parallel and task-posting bits from the _updating the image data_ algorithm. They were first introduced to support lazy loading when the spec when lazy loading was not specced in terms of IntersectionObserver, however now that it is, there's no reason to post the extra continuation task. I'm not 100% sure how to test for this, or if we even want to, but if it is desired, let me know and I can try and think of a test scenario.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5573/embedded-content.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 27, 2020, 8:54 PM UTC (2423cb0)\">/embedded-content.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5573/351d56a...2423cb0/embedded-content.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 27, 2020, 8:54 PM UTC (2423cb0)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5573/images.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 27, 2020, 8:54 PM UTC (2423cb0)\">/images.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5573/351d56a...2423cb0/images.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 27, 2020, 8:54 PM UTC (2423cb0)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5573/urls-and-fetching.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 27, 2020, 8:54 PM UTC (2423cb0)\">/urls-and-fetching.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5573/351d56a...2423cb0/urls-and-fetching.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 27, 2020, 8:54 PM UTC (2423cb0)\">diff</a> )",
